			"notes": "修复了添加命令时的长度限制问题以及当快捷键设置为键盘按键会闪烁的问题\n\n请注意，当输入内容过长时可能会导致触发Caused by: io.netty.handler.codec.EncoderException: String too big (was 400 characters, max 256)，目前版本仍存在长度为256的限制\n\n感谢MCMOD用户 finosh 的反馈\n\n————————————\n\nFixed a length limitation issue when adding commands and a flickering issue when shortcuts were set to keyboard keys.\n\nPlease note that typing something too long may cause a Caused by: io.netty.handler.codec.EncoderException: String too big (was 400 characters, max 256) to be triggered, and there is still a limit of 256 in the current version.\n\nThanks to MCMOD user finosh for the feedback!\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/LBY123165/Scroll-Whell-Command/compare/V0.2...V0.3"
